# PHP / WordPress Rules

- Namespace `RFQ\`; PSR-4 autoload from `includes/`
- Use `$wpdb->prepare()` for all dynamic SQL; `dbDelta()` for schema
- REST routes under `rfq/v1`; return `WP_REST_Response` or `WP_Error`
- Encrypt secrets with `RFQ_Secrets` (AES-256-GCM); never log credentials
- Rate limit: 10 sessions/hour/IP (`RFQ_SESSION_RATE_LIMIT`)
- On session create, set `s3_prefix = 'intake/{session_id}/'`

Tests: PHPUnit 11; tag with `@covers AC-WP-xxx` per `Planning/TESTING.md`.
